share/botocore/ holds botocore service-2.json files vendored from
upstream (https://github.com/boto/botocore) for any service that
does not have a Smithy IR equivalent.

Layout: share/botocore/<service>/<date>/service-2.json - matches
Paws::Model::Loader::Resolver's botocore search path. The resolver
prefers Smithy and falls back to Botocore on a per-service basis.

This directory is populated by a similar vendoring script (TBD; the
Smithy refresh covers the majority of services and a small number
need botocore as fallback).
